      "position": [760, 520],
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "sig-araranguá@contato.ufsc.br",
        "toEmail": "={{ $vars.EMAIL_SIG }}",
        "subject": "[SIG] Novo requerimento #{{ $json.requerimento_id }} — {{ $json.aluno_curso }}",
        "emailFormat": "html",
        "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='pt-BR'><head><meta charset='UTF-8'><style>body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f4f6f9;margin:0;padding:0}.container{max-width:600px;margin:32px auto;background:#fff;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}.header{background:#1e40af;color:#fff;padding:24px 32px}.header h1{margin:0;font-size:18px;font-weight:700}.body{padding:28px 32px;color:#334155;line-height:1.7}.badge{display:inline-block;background:#fef3c7;color:#b45309;border-radius:20px;padding:4px 14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:16px}.table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:16px 0;font-size:14px}.table th{background:#f1f5f9;text-align:left;padding:8px 12px;color:#475569;font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em}.table td{padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0}.link-btn{display:inline-block;background:#1e40af;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;padding:10px 24px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;margin-top:16px}.footer{background:#f1f5f9;padding:16px 32px;font-size:12px;color:#64748b;text-align:center}</style></head><body><div class='container'><div class='header'><h1>SIG — Novo Requerimento Recebido</h1></div><div class='body'><span class='badge'>{{ $json.tipo_requerimento }}</span><p>Um novo requerimento foi submetido e aguarda triagem.</p><table class='table'><tr><th>Campo</th><th>Valor</th></tr><tr><td><strong>ID</strong></td><td>#{{ $json.requerimento_id }}</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Aluno</strong></td><td>{{ $json.aluno_nome }}</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Matrícula</strong></td><td>{{ $json.aluno_matricula }}</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Curso</strong></td><td>{{ $json.aluno_curso }}</td></tr><tr><td><strong>E-mail</strong></td><td>{{ $json.aluno_email }}</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tipo</strong></td><td>{{ $json.tipo_requerimento }}</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Nº disciplinas</strong></td><td>{{ $json.total_validacoes }}</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Recebido em</strong></td><td>{{ $json.data_envio_formatada }}</td></tr></table><p><strong>Disciplinas solicitadas:</strong></p><ul>{{ $json.disciplinas_lista_html }}</ul></div><div class='footer'>Acesse o painel SIG para visualizar os documentos e iniciar a triagem.</div></div></body></html>",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "SUBSTITUIR_PELO_ID_DA_CREDENCIAL_SMTP",
          "name": "SMTP SIG UFSC"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Responder Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1020, 380],
      "parameters": {
